  "id": "13",
  "title": "Atlas ORM",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12) 0%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\"><strong>Atlas</strong> is the high-performance data backbone of Gravito. It provides a type-safe, Active Record ORM that balances the expressiveness of Eloquent with the performance of raw SQL.</p></div><h2>The Active Intelligence</h2><p>Atlas isn't just a query builder; it's a data orchestration layer. It bridges the gap between your domain logic and the persistence layer with zero abstraction penalty.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(245,158,11,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">STRICT_TYPES</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Leverage TypeScript decorators for runtime schema validation, compile-time property safety, and built-in **Optimistic Locking**. No more \"stringly-typed\" queries.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(245,158,11,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z\"/><path d=\"M5 3v4\"/><path d=\"M19 17v4\"/><path d=\"M3 5h4\"/><path d=\"M17 19h4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">ACTIVE_RECORD</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Intuitive <code>model.save()</code> and <code>model.delete()</code> operations that keep your code clean and your operations predictable.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(245,158,11,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 20a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v14a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h16Z\"/><path d=\"M12 4v16\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">MULTI_DRIVER</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Unified API for Postgres, MySQL, SQLite, MongoDB, and Redis. Switch backends with a single line of config.</p></div></div><h2>Data Model Definition</h2><p>Defining entities in Atlas is declarative. Decoration provides the necessary metadata for the engine to optimize SQL generation.</p><pre><code>import { Model, column } from '@gravito/atlas'\n\nexport class User extends Model {\n  static table = 'users'\n\n  @column({ isPrimary: true, autoIncrement: true })\n  declare id: number\n\n  @column()\n  declare email: string\n\n  @column({ type: 'json' })\n  declare settings: Record&lt;string, any&gt;\n}</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #F59E0B; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// CORE_HYGIENE: LAZY_DRIVERS</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Atlas uses dynamic imports for all database drivers. If you're using Postgres, only the <code>pg</code> driver is loaded. This keeps your runtime memory small and deployment artifacts lean.</p></div><h2>Fluent Query Pipeline</h2><p>The Atlas Query Builder is modeled after human logic. It handles complex joins, eager loading, and pagination with a chainable API.</p><pre><code>const posts = await Post.query()\n  .with(['author', 'comments'])\n  .where('published', true)\n  .whereHas('author', (q) => q.where('active', true))\n  .orderBy('created_at', 'desc')\n  .paginate(1, 15)</code></pre><h2>Performance: Abstraction Cost</h2><p>Atlas is designed to minimize the \"ORM Tax\". We utilize <strong>JIT Query Preparation</strong> to ensure that the time between your logic and the network socket is measured in microseconds.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #F59E0B; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>ATLAS_QUERY_OVERHEAD</span> <span>&lt; 0.05ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #F59E0B; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(245,158,11,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>GENERIC_TYPE_ORM_OVERHEAD</span> <span>~0.85ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 45%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// METRIC: ATLAS IS 15X LIGHTER THAN HEAVYWEIGHT NODE.JS ORMs</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Architect's Insight:</strong> Data integrity should never come at the cost of latency. Atlas provides the guardrails of an ORM with the raw power of a direct driver connection. It is the silent engine that powers your most critical data flows.</p></div>",
